1
00:00:00,186 --> 00:00:02,206
I don't feel like you're destroying me.

2
00:00:09,126 --> 00:00:11,006
Used to it.
Used to what?

3
00:00:14,446 --> 00:00:15,886
Hurting people.

4
00:00:17,226 --> 00:00:20,006
Because I wrote it
when I was in a bad mood.

5
00:00:21,806 --> 00:00:23,106
It's actually pretty good.

6
00:00:26,846 --> 00:00:30,046
Maybe we don't hurt each other.
Maybe there's tenderness.

7
00:00:30,906 --> 00:00:33,866
A kind of helpless love.
